{"2617740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cacildes Adventure", "steam_appid": 2617740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/f0b376463642dd4621344e65343d0266.avif?t=1785853592\" width=1328 height=1048 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO SLEPBONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your day is finally here - you have received your letter of admission into the king's army. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Prepare your potions and sharpen your sword, for the many roads of Slepbone await, ready to test your skills.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/be0770cf0b57f900ff038da993edfbc4.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT WITH STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Fight with sword, bow, shield or spells. Dual wield anything. Raise your strength or dexterity to the limits, parry or poke behind a shield, poison or petrify the most deadly of foes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every encounter encourages you to use your arsenal in creative ways.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/586d4599905d1c4ab25d26361d23ed0c.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A SOULSLIKE AT ITS CORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Explore an interconnected world with many branching paths filled with hidden places and secrets.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Combat requires precision and stamina management - with gear and accessories boosting what you can do in battle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Find upgrade materials and take your arsenal to the next level at a blacksmith anvil.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Discover all bonfires and rest before the next boss - and do not forget to pick your lost coins upon death!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/966027a547d2a5b6a5de524a36ee87cd.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A WAR IS RISING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Decide the fate of your homeland - the orcs seek a stone that holds their god in captivity; the same stone that feeds life into an elven village.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will you guide the orcs to their god, or keep beauty intact?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/d7ee8d428cb12db3a8738c970bab28d0.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPANSION: SUNKENLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Released in June 2024, this expansion introduces a new area called Sunkenland - explore the slumbering hills of a forgotten land, and find new bosses in the war-torn Obsidian Keep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/a2cc24c5e4596fc2af29b17b01b6283f.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPANSION: VEILGLADE PENINSULA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Released in September 2024, this expansion introduced swimming and a whole new island to explore - find the curse that haunts the Veilglades, as you explore an hidden crypt, an underwater college and a secret city from which no one has ever returned.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/c4a18502e49fe5e60ba958b4af60e49a.avif?t=1785853592\" width=443 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPANSION: WHISPERING VALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Released in December 2025, this expansion introduces a new region called Whispering Vale - explore a forest temple that has been ensnared by the melody of an ancient creature.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617740/extras/f0b376463642dd4621344e65343d0266.avif?t=1785853592\" width=1328 height=1048 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO SLEPBONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your day is finally here - you have received your letter of admission into the king's